      ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-105^\\circ\\right)=\\cos\\left(45^\\circ-150^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(45^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(150^\\circ\\right)+\\sin\\left(45^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(150^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
